WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Ndị nke m! Taa bụ akụkọ ihe mere eme!

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.800
Abụrụla m Papa — n'ezie!

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.200
Felix, biko — ọ bụ m bu ya ọnwa isii.

4
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.500
Ntuli aka m meriri! Mmeri ukwu!

5
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.500
Mama, anyị nwere ozi… Ada dị ime! Ọnwa
isii!

6
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.800
Ọnwa isii? Ọ bụ taa ka unu na-agwa m?

7
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Mama, anyị chọrọ ibu ụzọ hụ na ihe niile
dị mma…

8
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.800
Ịhụ gịnị? Na ọ bụ Felix nwe ime ahụ?

9
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.500
Mama! Ah-ah! Gịnị bụ nke a?!

10
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:43.000
Nwanyị bịara ọhụrụ, lụrụ naanị nwa m nwoke
— afọ apụtala.

11
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.800
N'ime Lagos a, mmadụ ga-ajụrịrị.

12
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:50.500
Mama, a na m asọpụrụ gị. Nwa a bụ nwa nwa
gị.

13
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.600
Anyị ga-ahụ. DNA ga-ekwu.

14
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:57.500
Ezi m, o bughi ya n'obi… Mama bụ onye
ọchị.

15
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.800
Felix, ọ bụ naanị gị bụ onye ọchị n'ụlọ a.

16
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.500
Meow… Uche Mama na-enyo enyo.

17
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.800
Ọ dịghị onye ga-akparị nwa m.

18
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.800
Ọ dịghị onye. M ṅụrụ iyi. Ọ bụrụgodị Mama.

19
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.500
Felix, buru ibu m. Site taa, m ga-ebi ebe
a.

20
00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:16.800
Onyenwe anyị ezitela ya… ka o lee anya.

21
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.500
Otú ahụ ka nsogbu ahụ si malite.
